endar_desc:"Sayfan\u0131n takvimi \u2014 g\xF6revler listeden oraya s\xFCr\xFCklenir.",plan_tab_note:"Proje notu",plan_tab_note_desc:"Sayfan\u0131n notu: proje, alan veya filtre. Di\u011Fer sayfalar\u0131n notu yoktur.",plan_tab_daily:"G\xFCnl\xFCk not",plan_tab_daily_desc:"Bug\xFCn\xFCn g\xFCnl\xFCk notu.",plan_tab_daily_off:"\u201CG\xFCnl\xFCk notlar\u201D \xE7ekirdek eklentisi kapal\u0131 \u2014 bu sekme \u015Fimdilik bo\u015F kalacak.",plan_tab_last:"En az bir giri\u015F etkin kalmal\u0131d\u0131r.",wn_plantabs_t:"Planlama g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFC art\u0131k yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131labilir",wn_plantabs_d:"Listenin yan\u0131nda art\u0131k takvim, proje notu ve g\xFCnl\xFCk not sekmeler h\xE2linde durabilir. Neyin g\xF6r\xFCnece\u011Fi ve neyin \xF6nde olaca\u011F\u0131 \u201CPlanlama g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFC\u201D alt\u0131nda ayarlan\u0131r.",wn_plannav_t:"Kenar \xE7ubu\u011Fu bulundu\u011Fun yerde a\xE7ar",wn_plannav_d:"Proje notundayken ba\u015Fka bir projeye mi t\u0131klad\u0131n? Tam o sekmede a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r \u2014 dosya listesinde t\u0131klamak gibi.",wn_planclose_t:"A\xE7, sonra yine kapat",wn_planclose_d:"Ayn\u0131 komut i\u015Fin bitince sa\u011F taraf\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131r ve liste her zamanki d\xFCzenine d\xF6ner. Pano ile \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yorsan listeye ge\xE7i\u015Fi tamamen kapatabilirsin.",menu_open_editor:"D\xFCzenleyicide a\xE7",menu_print:"Yazd\u0131r",menu_edit_task:"D\xFCzenle",menu_goto_project:"Projeye git",menu_move_project:"Ba\u015Fka projeye ta\u015F\u0131 \u2026",wn_ctxmenu_t:"G\xF6revlere sa\u011F t\u0131klama",wn_ctxmenu_d:"Yeni ba\u011Flam men\xFCs\xFC: listede, panoda veya takvimde bir g\xF6reve sa\u011F t\u0131klay\u0131n (veya bas\u0131l\u0131 tutun) \u2014 \xF6nemli eylemler sat\u0131r\u0131n hemen yan\u0131nda.",wn_dlcount_t:"Son teslim tarihleri say\u0131l\u0131r",wn_dlcount_d:"Biti\u015F tarihi olmayan bir g\xF6rev art\u0131k son teslim tarihinde g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr: Bug\xFCn, Yakla\u015Fan ve takvimde. Biti\u015F tarihi varsa yine yaln\u0131zca o belirler.",wn_events_t:"Etkinlikler ait olduklar\u0131 yerde",wn_events_d:"Google etkinlikleriniz art\u0131k yaln\u0131zca Bug\xFCn ve Yakla\u015Fan b\xF6l\xFCmlerinde g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr. Proje, etiket ve filtre takvimleri yeniden yaln\u0131zca kendi g\xF6revlerini g\xF6sterir.",wn_note_t:"Projeler notlar\u0131na kavu\u015Fuyor",wn_note_d:"Bir projenin, alan\u0131n veya filtrenin ard\u0131ndaki not art\u0131k senin: ba\u011Flam men\xFCs\xFCnden a\xE7 ve oraya ait olan\u0131 orada tut. Opal Tasks bu metne art\u0131k yazm\u0131yor. K\u0131sa h\xE2li i\xE7in g\xF6rev listesinin \xFCst\xFCnde bir a\xE7\u0131klama alan\u0131 var.",wn_tabs_t:"Her sayfa kendi sekmesinde, yan yana",wn_tabs_d:"Projeleri, filtreleri ve g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCmleri istedi\u011Finiz kadar yan yana a\xE7\u0131n. Her sekme kendi g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFCn\xFC, kayd\u0131rma konumunu ve zaman aral\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 korur; yeniden ba\u015Flat\u0131nca hepsini yeniden bulur.",wn_newtab_t:"Yeni sekmede a\xE7",wn_newtab_d:"Kenar \xE7ubu\u011Fundaki bir girdiye Ctrl veya orta t\u0131klama onu yanda a\xE7ar. Sa\u011F t\u0131k men\xFCs\xFCnde ayr\u0131ca \u201ESa\u011Fda a\xE7\u201C ve \u201EYeni pencerede a\xE7\u201C bulunur \u2013 dosya gezginindeki gibi.",wn_plan_t:"Planlama g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFC",wn_plan_d:"Tek bir komut ayn\u0131 sayfay\u0131 yan yana a\xE7ar: solda liste, sa\u011Fda takvim. Her g\xF6revi tarih se\xE7iciyle planlamak yerine soldan sa\u011Fa s\xFCr\xFCkleyerek planlay\u0131n.",wn_dragcal_t:"Listeden takvime s\xFCr\xFCkleyin",wn_dragcal_d:"G\xF6revler liste, pano ve takvim aras\u0131nda s\xFCr\xFCklenebilir \u2013 sayfa s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131 a\u015Farak da. Ba\u015Fka bir projenin takvimine b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131zda g\xF6rev oraya ta\u015F\u0131n\u0131r.",wn_vfilter_t:"Her g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCmde filtreleme",wn_vfilter_d:"Gelen kutusu, projeler, alanlar, etiketler, Bug\xFCn ve Yakla\u015Fan art\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm panelinde kendi \xABFiltre\xBB b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCne sahip: tarih, son teslim, \xF6ncelik, etiket, durum ve alt g\xF6revler. Se\xE7im, siz geri alana kadar sayfada kal\u0131r.",wn_vaxis_t:"Yaln\u0131zca a\xE7\u0131k olan sorular",wn_vaxis_d:"Proje sayfas\u0131nda proje filtresi, Bug\xFCn ve Yakla\u015Fan\u2019da tarih filtresi yoktur. G\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFCn zaten kendisi olan \u015Fey bir daha sorulmaz.",wn_vsave_t:"Filtre olarak kaydet",wn_vsave_d:"Ayarlad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z her \u015Fey kay\u0131tl\u0131 bir filtre olarak saklanabilir \u2014 bulundu\u011Funuz sayfan\u0131n projesi veya etiketiyle birlikte.",wn_vsignal_t:"Filtrelendi\u011Fi g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr",wn_vsignal_d:"G\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm d\xFC\u011Fmesi \xF6l\xE7\xFCt say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ta\u015F\u0131r; geriye bir \u015Fey kalmazsa sayfa bunu s\xF6yler ve s\u0131f\u0131rlamay\u0131 orada sunar.",wn_gcaldevice_t:"Google ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 cihaz ba\u015F\u0131na ge\xE7erli",wn_gcaldevice_d:"Art\u0131k cihazlar\u0131n\u0131z aras\u0131nda e\u015Fitlenmiyor. Her cihazda bir kez ba\u011Flan\u0131n; sonras\u0131nda orada kal\u0131r.",wn_gcalsafe_t:"Eri\u015Fiminiz art\u0131k yedeklerde de\u011Fil",wn_gcalsafe_d:"Google eri\u015Fimi art\u0131k yaln\u0131zca cihaz\u0131n kendisinde duruyor; yedeklerde, e\u015Fitleme kopyalar\u0131nda veya kasan\u0131z\u0131n s\xFCr\xFCm ge\xE7mi\u015Finde de\u011Fil.",wn_gcalquiet_t:"Daha az e\u015Fitleme \xE7ak\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131",wn_gcalquiet_d:"Ayar dosyas\u0131, yaln\u0131zca Google eri\u015Fimi yenilendi diye art\u0131k her saat yeniden yaz\u0131lm\u0131yor \u2014 cihazlar aras\u0131 \xE7ak\u0131\u015Fmalar\u0131n ba\u015Fl\u0131ca kayna\u011F\u0131yd\u0131.",wn_navdevice_t:"Kenar \xE7ubu\u011Fu cihaz ba\u015F\u0131na ge\xE7erli",wn_navdevice_d:"Katlanm\u0131\u015F ve a\xE7\u0131lm\u0131\u015F b\xF6l\xFCmler art\u0131k cihazlar aras\u0131nda aktar\u0131lm\u0131yor. Telefonda kapal\u0131 olmas\u0131 art\u0131k masa\xFCst\xFCnde de kapal\u0131 demek de\u011Fil.",wn_startpage_t:"Ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 sayfas\u0131 senin se\xE7imin",wn_startpage_d:"A\xE7\u0131l\u0131\u015Fta hangi sayfan\u0131n g\xF6r\xFCnece\u011Fine sen karar veriyorsun: Gelen kutusu, herhangi bir g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm, proje, alan, filtre ya da etiket \u2014 a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r liste yerine aramayla. Ve ayar yeniden i\u015Fe yar\u0131yor: etkin sekme oraya gider, di\u011Fer sekmelerin oldu\u011Fu yerde kal\u0131r.",wn_evcolor_t:"Etkinlikler Google rengiyle",wn_evcolor_d:"Google etkinlikleri, Google\u2019da ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131klar\u0131 renkle g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr \u2014 Google\u2019\u0131n haziranda ekledi\u011Fi yeni renkler dahil. Kendi rengi olmayan etkinlikler takvimlerinin rengini korur; o ton art\u0131k biraz daha belirgin.",wn_gcalkeep_t:"Google etkinlikleri orada eklediklerinizi koruyor",wn_gcalkeep_d:"Google Takvim'de bir etkinli\u011Fe a\xE7\u0131klama, konum, konuk veya renk eklerseniz art\u0131k korunuyor. Daha \xF6nce, g\xF6revi Obsidian'da de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmez kayboluyordu.",wn_dlrel_t:"Son teslim geri say\u0131m\u0131",wn_dlrel_d:"Tarih yerine \xF6nemli olan yazar: 3 g\xFCn i\xE7inde, Yar\u0131n, D\xFCn, 3 g\xFCn \xF6nce \u2014 yak\u0131nl\u0131\u011Fa g\xF6re renkli.",wn_dllate_t:"Ka\xE7\u0131r\u0131lan tarihler g\xF6ze \xE7arpar",wn_dllate_d:"Ge\xE7mi\u015F bir son teslim k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131ya d\xF6ner ve g\xF6revi geciken yapar \u2014 bug\xFCn zaten planl\u0131ysa hari\xE7.",wn_quickset_t:"Tarih ve \xF6ncelik tek t\u0131kla",wn_quickset_d:"Bug\xFCn, yar\u0131n, hafta sonu, gelecek hafta veya \xF6ncelik 1\u20134: g\xF6revi a\xE7madan men\xFCde tek t\u0131k yeter.",wn_ctxmore_t:"Gerisi de haz\u0131r",wn_ctxmore_d:"Hat\u0131rlat\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 d\xFCzenleyin, ba\u015Fka projeye ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131n, \xE7o\u011Falt\u0131n, ba\u011Flant\u0131y\u0131 kopyalay\u0131n veya silin \u2014 do\u011Frudan men\xFCden.",copy_suffix:"(Kopya)",msg_duplicated:"G\xF6rev \xE7o\u011Falt\u0131ld\u0131",msg_link_copied:"Ba\u011Flant\u0131 kopyaland\u0131",msg_link_copy_fai